# Non-code presentation/research deliverables
# Publication work products are kept outside Git.
/publications/
# NOTE: anchored to repo root with leading slash. core.ignorecase=true on this
# filesystem, so an unanchored "AACR/" also matches publications/aacr/ (a tracked
# code+figure dir) and silently ignores new files there. Keep these anchored.
/AACR/
publications/대한암학회/
monthly_meeting_*.pptx

